T*
(1\) Design Choices) Tj
T*
(Goal: build a recruiter-facing API that asks clarifying questions, returns grounded SHL) Tj
T*
(recommendations, refines results as constraints change, and compares assessments with catalog) Tj
T*
(evidence.) Tj
T*
(Architecture: FastAPI backend + React frontend, stateless chat API \(full message history each) Tj
T*
(request\).) Tj
T*
(Retrieval-first design: catalog decides recommendations; LLM is optional and used only for response) Tj
T*
(rewriting.) Tj
T*
(Explicit conversation states: clarifying, recommending, refining, comparing, refuse.) Tj
T*
(Structured contract: reply, recommendations, end_of_conversation, plus state/source/model metadata and) Tj
T*
(confidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Retrieval Setup) Tj
T*
(Data source: normalized local SHL catalog JSON.) Tj
T*
(User query parsing extracts role, seniority, test types, and skills.) Tj
T*
(Scoring uses weighted overlap: role \(5\), seniority \(4\), test type \(6\), skills/keywords \(4\), plus) Tj
T*
(direct type boost.) Tj
T*
(Results are ranked and returned as top matches, each with normalized confidence \(score / max_score\).) Tj
T*
(Comparison flow uses catalog name matching against mentioned assessments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Prompt Design) Tj
T*
(LLM: Groq llama-3.1-8b-instant \(optional\).) Tj
T*
(Prompt includes intent, user request, base deterministic answer, and grounded match list.) Tj
T*
(System guardrail: never invent assessments, URLs, or unsupported claims.) Tj
T*
(Fallback behavior: if LLM unavailable/fails, return deterministic catalog response.) Tj
