(4\) Evaluation Method) Tj
T*
(Automated tests validate API schema and conversational behavior: clarify, recommend, refine, compare,) Tj
T*
(and refuse.) Tj
T*
(Groq fallback and schema stability are tested to ensure model use does not break contract.) Tj
T*
(Evaluation harness runs both custom traces and recruiter persona suite.) Tj
T*
(Persona suite covers: Java mid-level cognitive request, refinement with personality addition, data) Tj
T*
(analyst screening, named comparison, vague intake clarification, and out-of-scope refusal.) Tj
T*
(Captured metrics: recommendation_count, state, reply_source, llm_model, average_confidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5\) What Did Not Work Initially) Tj
T*
(Unconstrained generation for recommendations increased hallucination risk.) Tj
T*
(Overly strict reply-text assertions became brittle once Groq paraphrasing was enabled.) Tj
T*
(Frontend metadata badges added noise for demo/interview flow and were removed based on feedback.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6\) How Improvement Was Measured) Tj
T*
(Test pass rate after each change \(final backend status: all tests passing\).) Tj
T*
(Persona-trace outcomes to verify correct state transitions and recommendation relevance.) Tj
T*
(Groundedness checks: recommendations and URLs must come from catalog data.) Tj
T*
(Operational visibility via response metadata and confidence values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Summary: The final system balances deterministic retrieval reliability with optional LLM readability) Tj
